      "description": "E1and Special Showcase WONDE1AND — PO HAO CHEN: MUSIC PRODUCTION, ARRANGEMENT, VOCAL PRODUCTION, MUSIC DIRECTION, GUITAR, BASS. 2026 · LIVE · LIVE PERFORMANCE.",
