    },
    "search": "E1and Special Showcase WONDE1AND 2026 LIVE LIVE PERFORMANCE MUSIC PRODUCTION ARRANGEMENT VOCAL PRODUCTION MUSIC DIRECTION GUITAR BASS LIVE ELECTRONICS RECORDING AUDIO EDITING SHOW / MUSIC PROGRAMMING POP ROCK J-POP EDM HIP HOP R&B GOLDEN CAVE CAFE, Taipei, Taiwan An immersive, up-close experimental small-scale showcase that feels like stepping into a room. With the stage designed by E1and herself, it blends a live band set with a DJ-style after-party to show her many sides. Its concept draws on Alice in Wonderland — song by song, like drawing back a lace curtain, it leads listeners into her most honest inner world, telling of her attachment to this city, her contradictions, her loneliness and her inspiration. This show wants to say to everyone who has ever felt alienated for being different: you are invited to feel freely in this space and simply enjoy yourself. Music Director PO HAO CHEN Electric Guitar Yu-Hsuan Jen Acoustic Guitar Chung-En Wei Bass Chung-En Wei Keyboards Yen-Cheng Chen Programmer PO HAO CHEN Band Leader PO HAO CHEN Arranger PO HAO CHEN Additional Arrangement Chung-En Wei Art Design Pin-Cheng Li Equipment Support puzzleman, Ko-Cheng Liu Hardware Coordination Yaohuan Ltd. Sound Engineering HANDONG PRODUCTION GROUP CO. LTD. Lighting Engineering Dollar Studio Stage Manager PO HAO CHEN Coordination Consultant / Backstage Assistant I-Shan Mao On-site Support Hung-Yu Kao, Pei-Ju Liu Guest Performers Jo-Hsin Huang, Sha-Sha Lo, RedLee Technical Support Yung-Jen Huang Photography Support Aron, Yu-Tsang Hsiao PR & Marketing Boris Assistant to the Music Director Yung-Jen Huang Executive Coordinator Boris Venue GOLDEN CAVE CAFE Supporting Sponsor Sleepy Tofu"
